# Set ONE of these. There is no fake mode: the co-pilot, extraction and analyst all call a real model.

# Free option: create a key at https://aistudio.google.com (Get API key). Check current free-tier limits there.
GEMINI_API_KEY=
# GEMINI_MODEL=gemini-3.8-flash      # also free-tier at time of writing: gemini-3.6-flash

# Paid option:
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
# ANTHROPIC_MODEL=claude-sonnet-5-5

# Optional: force a provider when both keys are set (gemini | anthropic)
# LLM_PROVIDER=gemini
